{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "d887bc8b-9382-45e6-b3c9-4040b72981ec", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 0, "ts": "2026-07-29T07:53:23.634000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "尽管这里用ttyS1作为串口，但是该串口实际上还没初始化。你来添加初始化代码\n\n你需要：\n初始化GPIO3_C5、C6为ALT模式，复用号AF9。\n初始化UART8。"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "d887bc8b-9382-45e6-b3c9-4040b72981ec", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 1, "ts": "2026-07-29T07:53:23.634000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "multi_replace_string_in_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/boards/rk3576/kickpi-k7/src/kickpi_k7_boardinit.c", "tool_name": "multi_replace_string_in_file", "tool_call_id": "db-multi_replace_string_in_file-0", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/boards/rk3576/kickpi-k7/src/kickpi_k7_boardinit.c"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "d887bc8b-9382-45e6-b3c9-4040b72981ec", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 2, "ts": "2026-07-29T07:53:23.634000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_serial.h", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-1", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_serial.h"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "d887bc8b-9382-45e6-b3c9-4040b72981ec", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 3, "ts": "2026-07-29T07:53:23.634000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "修改已完成。以下是所做的更改：\n\n1. **添加头文件** — 新增 `#include \"rk3576_serial.h\"`，提供 `rk3576_serial_register()` 和 `UART_PORT_8` 的声明。\n\n2. **GPIO 配置** — 在 `board_late_initialize()` 中添加：\n   - `GPIO3_C5`（UART8_RX_M0）配置为 **ALT + AF9 + PULLUP**（RX 引脚启用上拉）\n   - `GPIO3_C6`（UART8_TX_M0）配置为 **ALT + AF9**\n\n3. **UART8 注册** — 调用 `rk3576_serial_register(UART_PORT_8, 115200, 8, 0, false, 0, 0)` 将 UART8 注册为 `/dev/ttyS8`。\n\n4. **修正 ESP8266 设备名** — `esp8266_netdev_register` 的参数从 `\"/dev/ttyS1\"` 改为 `\"/dev/ttyS8\"`，与实际硬件连接的 UART8 对应。"}
